00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.300
And that's really useful.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.040
Then I did the towns
like this, where

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:47.130
you can see hour by hour how the
city moves in a different way.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.440
People are taking short
trips, long trips.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:53.130
In the morning, everyone
