00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.520
Though you can use
this for public policy.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.610
For example, you can
see here this chart

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:08.280
that at 5:00 PM in
the blue line there

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:11.070
is a big dip on the
number of taxi trips

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.620
that people are taking per hour.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:18.060
And the question is, why do
