00:26:00.380 --> 00:26:04.100
And I know this is
where you have it.

00:26:12.890 --> 00:26:15.320
OK, so let's just copy this.

00:26:18.350 --> 00:26:19.920
So you can see one
of the parameters

00:26:19.920 --> 00:26:22.740
is asking me to give the
pad for the GCS location.

00:26:26.010 --> 00:26:28.130
And just here dot CSV.

00:26:28.130 --> 00:26:29.770
Now, for the Big
Query side of things,

00:26:29.770 --> 00:26:31.775
I already created a data set.

00:26:31.775 --> 00:26:32.650
