00:37:25.530 --> 00:37:27.740
So let's go to the BigQuery.

00:37:27.740 --> 00:37:30.450
So if you remember
in my first set,

00:37:30.450 --> 00:37:32.910
I actually showed you
guys the empty data set.

00:37:32.910 --> 00:37:36.378
So if I refresh
this, you should be

00:37:36.378 --> 00:37:37.920
able to see the
