Let me do it here
first and then do this.

00:40:43.780 --> 00:40:46.620
OK, so let's do a comparison
about this record.

00:40:46.620 --> 00:40:47.890
So this is in the Cloud Shell.

00:40:47.890 --> 00:40:49.960
You're seeing the actual record.

00:40:49.960 --> 00:40:53.300
So apparently he--
sorry, so Carson--

00:40:53.300 --> 00:40:55.910
the original name is
Carson [INAUDIBLE]..

