And this person is
27 years old CEO.

00:41:00.740 --> 00:41:04.370
So if you look at on
the cardholders name--

00:41:04.370 --> 00:41:07.410
I'll make it a little
bit bigger here.

00:41:07.410 --> 00:41:11.940
So this is all tokenized
with crypto hash.

00:41:11.940 --> 00:41:13.900
If you look at the job title--

00:41:13.900 --> 00:41:16.050
so CEO, since we're
using bucketing,

00:41:16.050 --> 00:41:18.870
is being transferred
to executive.

00:41:18.870 --> 00:41:23.208
Look at the SSN number,
which is a direct identifier.

00:41:23.208 --> 00:41:29.870
So if you look SSN here, 209
number, it's being transferred.

00:41:29.870 --> 00:41:32.570
27 years become 18.

00:41:32.570 --> 00:41:35.445
If you look the card pin,
which is also changed,

00:41:35.445 --> 00:41:37.070
so that's one of the
direct identifiers

00:41:37.070 --> 00:41:43.900
that we're using, using
format preservation algorithm.

00:41:43.900 --> 00:41:49.610
And if you look at
the card number here,

00:41:49.610 --> 00:41:51.380
so it start with the
original card number.

00:41:51.380 --> 00:41:53.400
So it's 3735.

00:41:53.400 --> 00:41:56.160
But it's been changed to a
completely different number.

00:42:02.570 --> 00:42:04.250
So just quickly,
before I end this demo,

00:42:04.250 --> 00:42:06.770
I just wanted to mention
that for the Dataflow job,

00:42:06.770 --> 00:42:07.790
it could--

00:42:07.790 --> 00:42:11.870
it doesn't have to be
from JCS to Big Query.

00:42:11.870 --> 00:42:13.520
It could very
