00:42:13.520 --> 00:42:17.600
That code became what I ran
is actually open sourced.

00:42:17.600 --> 00:42:19.910
So you could go to the
Google Cloud Platform GitHub

00:42:19.910 --> 00:42:21.295
page and just search for DLP.

00:42:21.295 --> 00:42:23.180
You should be able to see.

00:42:23.180 --> 00:42:26.510
Another thing is it could
also run those Dataflow

00:42:26.510 --> 00:42:28.437
job using j cloud comment.

00:42:28.437 --> 00:42:30.020
It doesn't have to
be UI if you wanted

00:42:30.020 --> 00:42:32.395
to schedule it with the Cloud
Composer or something else.

00:42:35.000 --> 00:42:38.530
With that, I'll hand it over to
